                            	  2660:     ; *Signed comparison*:
                            	  2661:     ; If the high speed byte < high max speed byte, then return.
                            	  2662:     ;
                            	  2663:     ; Note that this is not a general purpose signed comparison,
                            	  2664:     ; which would be more complicated. But it works because
                            	  2665:     ; the deviation from 0 of both values is small.
                            	  2666:     ;
