                            	  7514: _anon_z05_156:
02:00042BBA 101D            	  7515:     move.b  (A5)+,D0  ; PLA
                            	  7516:     ; If the player is at an "open", "key", or "shutter" door,
                            	  7517:     ; then the player walked all the way to the edge of the play
                            	  7518:     ; area. So, use index 2 to set Link's relative position to 0.
                            	  7519:     ;
                            	  7520:     ; Otherwise, the player is at wall level. Link has to walk to the
                            	  7521:     ; edge of the play area. So, set a relative position that
                            	  7522:     ; reflects that distance: $28 or -$28.
                            	  7523:     ;
                            	  7524:     ; If walking in a decreasing direction (left or up), then
                            	  7525:     ; Link's relative position is $28 and has to decrease to 0.
                            	  7526:     ;
                            	  7527:     ; If walking in an increasing direction (right or down), then
                            	  7528:     ; Link's relative position is -$28 and has to increase to 0.
                            	  7529:     ;
